<li>
<p>Upgrade nexus publishing and staging to new gradle-nexus.publish-plugin (#1043)</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Upgrade remaining dependency on junit 4.12 to 4.13.2 (#1044)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</dd>
